ON D.G.:Anderson D.G. is an author who researched peripheral parenteral nutrition.", "HOHEIM D.F.:Hoheim D.F. is an author who studied clinical experiences with three-in-one admixtures for parenteral nutrition.", "BAUER P.:Bauer P. is an author who researched the combination of parenteral and enteral nutrition in critically ill patients.", "DVIR D.:Dvir D. is an author who conducted an observational study on energy balance and complications in critically ill patients.", "VILLET S.:Villet S. is an author who studied the negative impact of hypocaloric feeding on clinical outcomes in ICU patients.", "KOVACEVICH D.S.:Kovacevich D.S. is an author who contributed to the standards for specialized nutrition support for home care patients.", "MIRTALLO J.:Mirtallo J. is an author involved in the task force for safe practices in parenteral nutrition.", "MIRTALLO J.M.:", "TASK FORCE FOR THE REVISION OF SAFE PRACTICES FOR PARENTERAL NUTRITION:The \"TASK FORCE FOR THE REVISION OF SAFE PRACTICES FOR PARENTERAL NUTRITION\" is a dedicated group that focuses on establishing and revising safe practices for parenteral nutrition. This task force plays a crucial role in contributing to guidelines and recommendations within the field of nutrition support therapy, ensuring that best practices are upheld to enhance patient safety and care.", "GERMAN SOCIETY FOR NUTRITIONAL MEDICINE:A professional organization that provides guidelines and recommendations for nutritional practices in Germany, particularly in clinical settings."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}